<title>USA: NYSE unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Friday that Corimon SACA was unavailable for after hours trading, while Morgan Hydrocarbons Inc was unavailable for news.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
